Ars Magica rulebook content — Ars Magica Open License (CC-BY-SA 4.0)
===================================================================

This directory (`rules/source/`) contains the human-authored Ars Magica 5th
Edition rulebook text used as the authoritative source for this project. This
content is NOT covered by the MIT License that governs the project's source code
(see the top-level `LICENSE` file).

